{
  "instructions": "For each pasted NEKODEX request, begin with codex_turn_start using the request_id in its request block. Use that request_id with the Codex tools needed for the task. When the task is finished, send the complete answer with codex_turn_complete. If a tool returns an error, report that error instead of changing the request_id. A cancelled or timed-out Codex Native tool call retires this entire request_id; do not retry it or use it for sibling calls.",
  "tools": [
